    "_comment": "Bounded repair ladder (repair_escalation.py): CURRENT -> DIFFICULT_IMPLEMENTER (strong model, diagnosis first) -> PLANNER_DIAGNOSIS -> Human Gate. EFFORT_UP is skipped (max_effort_steps 0): another, longer attempt by the same weak model family rarely converges.",
